### VS Code REST Client / HTTP file sample. Scaffold mutating requests return 501 until implemented.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### health
GET {{base}}/health

### feed page
GET {{base}}/feed

### user search
GET {{base}}/search?q=ali

### posts upload - form client / multipart recommended (HTML upload form)
### /upload page sends multipart names image, caption, csrf_token.

### comment POST (authenticated session+CSRF required once implemented)
POST {{base}}/posts/105/comments
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=hello

### like
POST {{base}}/posts/105/likes

### unlike
DELETE {{base}}/posts/105/likes

### follow
POST {{base}}/users/alice/follow

### unfollow
DELETE {{base}}/users/alice/follow
